row source concordance and independent BLOCK reviews with their original evidence.\n\nThe current progress text separates five bounded C9e repairs from 17 mandatory source finding groups, the chain-birth P1 and the unproved provider/continuation work. This documentation commit does not import C331 production code or change the runtime defaults, rules, archive, ABI or protocol versions.\n\nValidation: 9,905 enumerated paths / 257,498,242 bytes; every staged blob and mode matches the reviewed candidate tree. Eight narrative documents have 861 valid local links; 1,065 line references have no out-of-range targets (six existing example-path categories remain unresolved); source-line gate and its two unit tests pass. Independent documentation review found no issues. Runtime acceptance remains bounded by each archived source version.","timestamp":"2026-10-31T17:58:27Z","author":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com"},"committer":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com"}},"repository":{"id":1269455162,"node_id":"R_kgDOS6pZOg","name":"RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified","full_name":"RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified","private":false,"owner":{"login":"RuyimgByCN","id":45452808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDUyODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45452808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN","html_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN/events{/privacy}","received_ev